OL,3,AReform up against 'complainants'
OL,4,Asociety', Farage tells BBC
OL,5,
OL,6,FNigel Farage has said the UK is a
OL,7,F"complainants' society", as he faces
OL,8,Fongoing questions about both his and
OL,9,Fhis party's finances.
OL,11,FSpeaking to the BBC ahead of the
OL,12,Fparty's annual conference this week,
OL,13,Fthe Reform UK leader said a "whole
OL,14,Fecosystem" didn't want "new kids on the
OL,15,Fblock succeeding".
OL,17,FIt comes after a summer dominated by
OL,18,Fheadlines about the party's finances
OL,19,Fand #5m he received from a party
OL,20,Fsupporter before the last election.
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/38
