OL,3,AProtests in Spain over government's
OL,4,Ahandling of Ceuta migrant crisis
OL,5,
OL,6,FOn Wednesday a police report said
OL,7,FMoroccan security forces showed "total
OL,8,Fpermissiveness" during the
OL,9,Funprecedented influx, days after
OL,10,FSanchez insisted Morocco was not
OL,11,Fresponsible.
OL,13,FHe has blamed trafficking gangs and
OL,14,Fonline misinformation for encouraging
OL,15,Fpeople to cross the border. Morocco has
OL,16,Fdenied orchestrating or being involved
OL,17,Fin the mass crossing.
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/38
